OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPCs who Tasered amputee, 92, used
OL,4,Aexcessive force
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurgess, who had dementia, was hit with
OL,7,Fa baton, pepper sprayed and Tasered in
OL,8,Fhis wheelchair during the incident in
OL,9,FJune 2022.
OL,11,FAt a hearing at Sussex Police
OL,12,Fheadquarters, a panel decided there was
OL,13,F"unjustified and excessive use of
OL,14,Fforce" and gross misconduct had been
OL,15,Fproven for both officers.
